    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Toilet Empire \u2013 The Kingdom of Cleanliness in Your Hands!</strong></h2><br><strong>Your goal? Make sure your toilets are clean, modern, and profitable, so customers always leave satisfied\u2026 and refreshed! </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/f69b2e04add61b87d47a291e715a4f70.poster.avif?t=1742331658\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/f69b2e04add61b87d47a291e715a4f70.webm?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/f69b2e04add61b87d47a291e715a4f70.mp4?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansion &amp; Management \u2013 From a Portable Stall to Luxury VIP Toilets!</h2>Your journey begins with a single restroom, but that's just the start! Purchase new plots, invest in bigger and better facilities, and even build exclusive premium toilets for the most demanding customers. Over time, you can create a sanitary network that becomes an essential part of every major city!<br><br>Will you go for cheap and functional, or aim for luxury and innovation? The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/fce7006975fddc7056bbe549fabccb08.poster.avif?t=1742331658\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/fce7006975fddc7056bbe549fabccb08.webm?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/fce7006975fddc7056bbe549fabccb08.mp4?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleaning &amp; Maintenance \u2013 Hygiene is Everything!</h2>Dirty toilets scare away customers and ruin your reputation! Hire cleaning crews or roll up your sleeves and scrub them yourself. Each toilet needs regular cleaning, waste disposal, and repairs\u2014and sometimes even\u2026 disinfection after particularly problematic guests.<br><br>Remember to upgrade your facilities with automatic cleaning systems, air fresheners, and even relaxing music to ensure customer comfort.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/9dd510a436e26d79f3582f833afa6611.poster.avif?t=1742331658\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/9dd510a436e26d79f3582f833afa6611.webm?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/9dd510a436e26d79f3582f833afa6611.mp4?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Business Growth \u2013 More Toilets, More Profits!</h2>Expand your company by investing in cutting-edge technologies, such as self-cleaning toilets, automatic temperature regulation, or smart cabins that analyze customer needs. You can also increase fees for high-end restroom access or introduce VIP subscriptions for regular users!<br><br>As your empire grows, you can hire managers to optimize operations and logistics experts to ensure smooth business expansion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/635b8d07f7b548029770b87510348cbb.poster.avif?t=1742331658\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/635b8d07f7b548029770b87510348cbb.webm?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/635b8d07f7b548029770b87510348cbb.mp4?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Locations \u2013 Sanitary Challenges Around the World!</h2>Your toilets can be found everywhere! Serve parks, shopping malls, beaches, stadiums, festivals, airports, and even space stations!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/798d6f5f755a7cbbb554f1424654ebb3.poster.avif?t=1742331658\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/798d6f5f755a7cbbb554f1424654ebb3.webm?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/798d6f5f755a7cbbb554f1424654ebb3.mp4?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customer Interactions \u2013 Their Comfort, Your Profit!</h2>Your customers aren\u2019t just nameless NPCs\u2014each one has unique needs and expectations! Some require quick and easy access, while others seek luxury experiences. Keep their satisfaction levels high, gather feedback, and adjust your services accordingly.<br><br>Beware of troublemakers\u2014some might leave behind &quot;surprises,&quot; while others try to sneak in without paying or even vandalize your facilities!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/e17d614bc160f49c78ce93747f609a57.poster.avif?t=1742331658\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/e17d614bc160f49c78ce93747f609a57.webm?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/e17d614bc160f49c78ce93747f609a57.mp4?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unexpected Challenges \u2013 Be Ready for Anything!</h2>Running a restroom empire comes with its fair share of surprises! Can you handle:<br>A sewage system failure during a major festival?<br>A sudden water shortage across the entire city?<br>Competitor sabotage, spreading fake negative reviews?<br>Flooded toilets after heavy rain?<br>Suspicious customers engaging in illegal activities or vandalizing stalls?<br><br>Managing a sanitation empire is no walk in the park\u2014it\u2019s a true test of strategy and business acumen!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/4fc69802652e85742701cf7fc5cf2cc1.poster.avif?t=1742331658\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/4fc69802652e85742701cf7fc5cf2cc1.webm?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/4fc69802652e85742701cf7fc5cf2cc1.mp4?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Humor &amp; Absurdity \u2013 Because Toilets Are More Than Just Business!</h2>The game doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously! Absurd events, bizarre customers, and hilarious challenges make Toilet Empire not just a simulation but also a source of pure entertainment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/b1e1ef170a48fc47c08a47247556d59e.poster.avif?t=1742331658\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/b1e1ef170a48fc47c08a47247556d59e.webm?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541770/extras/b1e1ef170a48fc47c08a47247556d59e.mp4?t=1742331658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A clean deal\u2014jump into Toilet Empire!</h2>",
